guidebook.section.mob.watercreeper.name=Water Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.watercreeper.desc=Floods the ground around it instead of cratering it.\nStill water, so it stays where it lands.
guidebook.section.mob.firecreeper.name=Fire Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.firecreeper.desc=Scatters fire across open ground.\nImmune to fire itself.
guidebook.section.mob.icecreeper.name=Ice Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.icecreeper.desc=Freezes water to ice, lava to obsidian, and lays snow over everything else.\nBy far the widest effect of the nine.
guidebook.section.mob.electriccreeper.name=Electric Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.electriccreeper.desc=Calls a lightning bolt down on every nearby creature.\nOther creepers are spared.
guidebook.section.mob.earthcreeper.name=Earth Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.earthcreeper.desc=Buries its surroundings in dirt, in the air as well as on the ground.
guidebook.section.mob.psychiccreeper.name=Psychic Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.psychiccreeper.desc=Throws everything nearby into the sky and does no damage at all.\nThe landing is the dangerous part.
guidebook.section.mob.cookiecreeper.name=Cookie Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.cookiecreeper.desc=Harmless. Showers the area in cookies and nothing else.\nRare.
guidebook.section.mob.magmacreeper.name=Magma Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.magmacreeper.desc=Leaves a trail of fire wherever it walks and pools lava where it dies.\nFound only in the Nether.
guidebook.section.mob.ghostcreeper.name=Ghost Creeper
guidebook.section.mob.ghostcreeper.desc=See-through, and left behind when another elemental creeper dies.\nIts blast passes through walls without breaking them, and it hits harder than anything else here.
